 wrong:["Riboflavin (B2): angular stomatitis, cheilosis, glossitis, corneal vascularization","Vitamin C: scurvy — gum bleeding, perifollicular hemorrhage, pseudoparalysis","Zinc: acrodermatitis enteropathica (ผื่นรอบปาก/ทวาร, ท้องเสีย, ผมร่วง)","Vitamin E: hemolytic anemia ใน preterm, ataxia, neuropathy"],
